<%# Test-only layout for WalletConnectPickerTest. Lives under a TEST view-path
    root, never app/views — a layout in the gem's app/views ships to every
    consumer. It RENDERS THE PICKER, the way an app does (the host lives in the
    layout), so the picker renders during the LAYOUT pass, when view_flow[:layout]
    already holds the page body. From the TEMPLATE that flow is still empty and
    nothing can leak — which is how the first version of this probe went inert. %>
<div id="probe-host"><%= render "studio/modals/wallet_connect" %></div>
<%= yield %>
